      "content": "Thanks. That helps a bit. I'm also seeing a lot of very fine, irregular fragmentation in this specific layer—like the pieces are almost too small and scattered to reconstruct any specific vessel profile. Does the pattern of how the ceramics broke or the way the fragments are distributed in the soil suggest anything specific about the depositional environment or how the vessels were destroyed?",
